      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk... it doesn't feel like a \"space\" to explore. it just feels finished. like there's no more plot, no more character development, just the silence. when a story is done, you don't keep reading the blank pages, you just close the book. why am i supposed to pretend there's something more to find in a book that's clearly over?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
